msgctxt "148"
msgid "My presentation went great! Time to celebrate with some Tantakatan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Oh, is that the shochu made from perilla leaves?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"All the girls at the office are obsessed with it. We usually mix it with "
"cranberry juice!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "You know, we should get the team together and head down to a bar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Good idea. Everyone's been working so hard lately, after all. Might be nice "
"to take a night off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Well, then, let's get going. Mind giving everyone at the company a call?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid ""
"(Tantakatan, huh? I should remember this when I'm over at a cabaret club.)"
msgstr ""

